  "question": {
    "text": "An ideal monoatomic gas at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> expands adiabatically to twice its volume. The final temperature of gas is"
